Error: Jet.EffectBoundExceeded: `visit` uses the effect `DB.Write`, which a live query doesn't allow
  --> Tests/UI/app_live_write_query.jet:12:23
    |
 12 |     binding: app.live(visit, "jet")
    |                       ^^^^^
 Why: `live` re-runs its query whenever the data it read changes, so the query may only read the database
 Fix: Keep the query to `-[DB.Read]>`, or use `subscribe` for a source that also fetches over `Net` or waits on `Time`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.EffectBoundExceeded
